From: sinful1992 <sinful1992@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:49:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] [kml] Import KML/GPX files that start with a blank line

expat only accepts the XML declaration as the very first bytes, so files
saved from web pages with a leading newline (or a BOM followed by one)
failed with "Could not parse GPX/KML". Skip a UTF-8 BOM and leading
whitespace before handing the file to the parser.

Fixes #3963
